# Keep secrets and local junk out of the Docker build context.
# .npmrc reaches the build only through a --secret mount, never COPY.
# Docker matches patterns from the context root only, so **/ is needed
# to catch copies in subfolders (e.g. cg-libs/.npmrc).
.npmrc
**/.npmrc
.netrc
**/.netrc
.env
node_modules/
**/node_modules/
.git/
scans/
*.log
